// REQUIRES: long
// P04.05 review R15: the map-entry arguments of one call lower in time
// linear in their number (one record each and one runtime call that
// resolves the aliasing at run time): 4N take at most 12 times as long as
// N. The control (core-stress-str-6.long.test) emits GIR for every pair of them
// (LowerOptions::PairwiseEntryArgs) and must fail the same check. The normal
// suite counts the work instead (GIRStress.TheLoweringOfEntryArgumentsIsLinear).
// RUN: timeout 300 %gopp_unit_tests --gtest_also_run_disabled_tests --gtest_filter='GIRStressLong.DISABLED_LoweringManyEntryArguments'
